{
  "_template_meta": {
    "name": "success-card-template",
    "type": "success",
    "description": "成功类卡片模板（任务完成 + 检查通过 + 分享/存档）",
    "header_template": "green",
    "color_scheme": "green 系邻近色环（green-50 + yellow-50 + grey-50）",
    "usage": "适合任务完成通知、检查通过、CI/CD 成功、部署成功"
  },
  "schema": "2.0",
  "config": {
    "wide_screen_mode": true,
    "update_multi": true
  },
  "header": {
    "title": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{{YYYYMMDD}}-成功通知-{{任务名}}-{{完成状态}}"
    },
    "subtitle": {
      "tag": "plain_text",
      "content": "{{YYYY-MM-DD}} · 任务完成"
    },
    "template": "green"
  },
  "body": {
    "direction": "vertical",
    "padding": "16px 16px 16px 16px",
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "column_set",
        "flex_mode": "none",
        "background_style": "green-50",
        "columns": [
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "vertical_align": "top",
            "background_style": "green-50",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "content": "### ✅ 任务完成\n\n**{{任务名}}**\n\n📅 开始时间：{{YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM}}\n📅 完成时间：{{YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM}}\n⏱️ 总耗时：{{X 分钟 / X 小时}}\n\n{{任务摘要：1-2 句话描述完成情况}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "column_set",
        "flex_mode": "none",
        "background_style": "green-50",
        "columns": [
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "vertical_align": "top",
            "background_style": "green-50",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "content": "### ✅ 检查通过\n\n- [x] {{检查项1}}：通过\n- [x] {{检查项2}}：通过\n- [x] {{检查项3}}：通过\n- [x] {{检查项4}}：通过\n\n**{{N}}/{{M}} 项检查全部通过**"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "column_set",
        "flex_mode": "none",
        "background_style": "grey-50",
        "columns": [
          {
            "tag": "column",
            "width": "weighted",
            "weight": 1,
            "vertical_align": "top",
            "background_style": "grey-50",
            "elements": [
              {
                "tag": "markdown",
                "content": "### 📊 产出统计\n\n- {{产出1}}：{{数量1}}\n- {{产出2}}：{{数量2}}\n- {{产出3}}：{{数量3}}\n\n**{{关键数字}}**：{{说明}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "button",
        "text": {
          "tag": "plain_text",
          "content": "📤 分享到群"
        },
        "type": "default",
        "width": "fill",
        "behaviors": [
          {
            "type": "open_url",
            "default_url": "https://example.com/share"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "button",
        "text": {
          "tag": "plain_text",
          "content": "📦 存档到知识库"
        },
        "type": "default",
        "width": "fill",
        "behaviors": [
          {
            "type": "open_url",
            "default_url": "https://example.com/wiki-add"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "button",
        "text": {
          "tag": "plain_text",
          "content": "📄 查看完整报告"
        },
        "type": "primary",
        "width": "fill",
        "behaviors": [
          {
            "type": "open_url",
            "default_url": "{{文档URL}}"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "> 🤖 {{来源标识}} · {{触发时间}} 自动通知 · ✅ 全部检查通过"
      }
    ]
  }
}
